  m_text: "\u2022 Classification: Anti-Personnel (AP) Bounding Fragmentation.\n\u2022
    Mechanism: Tripwire or Command Detonation.\n\u2022 Operation: Upon activation,
    a propellant charge launches the mine to a height of 0.6\u20130.8m before the
    main charge detonates.\n\u2022 Lethality: 2,400 steel fragments with a 30-meter
    lethal radius (360\xB0 coverage).\n\u2022 EOD Protocol: Highly dangerous due
    to tripwire sensitivity. Neutralization requires inserting a safety pin into
    the striker mechanism to prevent vertical displacement before cutting any wires."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
