  m_text: "\u2022 Classification: Scatterable Blast Mine.\n\u2022 Case Material:
    Low-density Polyethylene (Plastic).\n\u2022 Explosive Mass: 40g Liquid Explosive
    (VS-6D).\n\u2022 Activation: Cumulative pressure (5 kg+).\n\u2022 EOD Protocol:
    Non-disarmable. The plastic casing makes detection with standard metal detectors
    difficult. Due to the instability of the liquid explosive and the sensitivity
    of the internal hydraulic fuse, manual handling is strictly prohibited.\n\u2022
    Disposal: Destruction in place via external charge or mechanical means."
